---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact PromptDNS: general questions, feedback, partnerships, and press."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Say hello.</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ink-dim">
      Questions, corrections, tool requests, partnerships, or press, email is the fastest way
      to reach us. We read everything and typically reply within one business day.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <a href="mailto:hello@promptdns.com" class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent/40">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-faint">General</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-lg text-accent">hello@promptdns.com</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-dim">Questions, feedback, tool requests.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:partners@promptdns.com" class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet/40">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-faint">Partnerships & press</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-lg text-accent">partners@promptdns.com</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-dim">Integrations, data partnerships, media.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/40 p-6">
      <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Before you write</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
        If a tool showed an unexpected result, include: the domain, the record type, the
        resolver shown, and your expectation. If a guide is wrong, include the URL and the
        step that failed, we fix verified errors within days and credit contributors.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
